<view class="page receipt-page af2-page">
  <view class="receipt-heading"><text class="receipt-kicker">现场记录</text><text class="receipt-title">我的现场反馈</text><text class="receipt-subtitle">当前水站 · 本人反馈</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state" aria-role="status">正在读取反馈记录…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state receipt-error"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="load" class="af-action af-action--secondary">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{items.length === 0}}" class="state receipt-empty"><text class="receipt-empty-title">暂无可显示的反馈</text><text>现场反馈提交后，可在这里查看处理进展。历史或跨站记录请联系站长核实。</text></view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="receipt-card-head"><text class="receipt-status">{{item.statusText}}</text><text class="receipt-ref">订单 #{{item.orderId}} · 反馈 #{{item.id}}</text></view>
    <view class="receipt-content"><text class="receipt-label">现场反馈</text><text class="receipt-note">{{item.staffNote || '未记录'}}</text></view>
    <view class="receipt-timeline receipt-time-list">
      <text class="receipt-section-kicker">已登记时间</text>
      <view class="receipt-event" wx:if="{{item.createdAt}}"><text class="receipt-event-label">上报时间</text><text class="receipt-event-value">{{item.createdAt}}</text></view>
      <view class="receipt-event" wx:if="{{item.decidedAt}}"><text class="receipt-event-label">处理时间</text><text class="receipt-event-value">{{item.decidedAt}}</text></view>
      <view class="receipt-event" wx:if="{{item.executedAt}}"><text class="receipt-event-label">执行时间</text><text class="receipt-event-value">{{item.executedAt}}</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="hint">显示当前水站最近 100 条本人反馈。历史或跨站记录可请站长核实。</view>
</view>
